:: Monday_Morning
It is the dawn of a new day, and you are the undisputed owner of the Discus: A once-famous restaurant operating for over a thousand years. Legends were birthed in this crucible, a location so conveniently located at the intersections of life: extravagant commerce, mysterious wormholes, a thousand rival nation states. They all come to your table, to eat, sing, scream, to live life as it was meant to be.

How long you have dreamed to become a legend, to restore the Discus to its rightful place amongst history again.

:: Monday_Evening
The few customers you have accrued today slowly trickle out. Your business for the day is winding down, and you are nearly exhausted. Becoming a legend is hard work, and you've earned this respite. You relax your body, unprepared for anything unsurprising.

:: Monday_Draw
